<p> Shr  loss	 0.07	   loss    0.05</p>
<p> Net  loss	 330	    loss    245</p>
<p>(All data above 000s in U.S. except per share numbers)</p>
<p>Note: The company said it had net assets of about U.S. $65.3 million. The net asset value per share was U.S. $14.48, based on 4,507,318 shares outstanding.</p>
<p>In comparison, net assets for the same period a year ago was U.S. $42.2 million, or U.S. $9.36 per share, based on 4,507,318 shares outstanding.</p>
